          "settings": {
            "heading": "What are your shipping costs and delivery times?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Below are estimated tracked shipping prices and delivery times. Rural and remote locations may cost more and take longer.</p><ul><li><strong>USA</strong>: US$5.99 (5-9 working days) · US$9.99 (3-5 working days) · Alaska, Hawaii, territories, and military addresses take longer.</li><li><strong>Canada</strong>: CA$14.99+ (2-4 working days)</li><li><strong>UK</strong>: £5.99 (2-3 working days) · £6.99 (1-2 working days)</li><li><strong>Australia</strong>: AU$19.99 (6-9 working days)</li><li><strong>New Zealand</strong>: NZ$23.99 (7-10 working days)</li><li><strong>Austria</strong>: €8,75 (3-4 working days)</li><li><strong>Belgium</strong>: €7,99 (2-3 working days)</li><li><strong>Bulgaria</strong>: €11,99 (6-8 working days)</li><li><strong>Croatia</strong>: €11,75 (4-6 working days)</li><li><strong>Cyprus</strong>: €14,25 (6-8 working days)</li><li><strong>Czechia</strong>: €8,99 (3-4 working days)</li><li><strong>Denmark</strong>: €11,75 (3-4 working days)</li><li><strong>Estonia</strong>: €13,25 (6-7 working days)</li><li><strong>Finland</strong>: €14,75 (5-6 working days)</li><li><strong>France</strong>: €7,75 (2-3 working days)</li><li><strong>Germany</strong>: €6,99 (2-3 working days)</li><li><strong>Greece</strong>: €15,99 (7-9 working days)</li><li><strong>Hungary</strong>: €9,25 (3-5 working days)</li><li><strong>Ireland</strong>: €11,75 (3-5 working days)</li><li><strong>Italy</strong>: €12,99 (3-4 working days)</li><li><strong>Latvia</strong>: €10,99 (3-5 working days)</li><li><strong>Lithuania</strong>: €10,99 (3-5 working days)</li><li><strong>Luxembourg</strong>: €12,25 (3-5 working days)</li><li><strong>Malta</strong>: €15,99 (3-5 working days)</li><li><strong>Netherlands</strong>: €6,49 (1-2 working days)</li><li><strong>Poland</strong>: €8,75 (3-5 working days)</li><li><strong>Portugal</strong>: €11,99 (3-4 working days)</li><li><strong>Romania</strong>: €11,75 (3-5 working days)</li><li><strong>Slovakia</strong>: €13,49 (3-5 working days)</li><li><strong>Slovenia</strong>: €12,75 (3-5 working days)</li><li><strong>Spain</strong>: €8,25 (2-3 working days)</li><li><strong>Sweden</strong>: €11,75 (3-4 working days)</li><li><strong>Argentina</strong>: US$24.99 (6-12 working days)</li><li><strong>Belarus</strong>: US$15.99 (8-12 working days)</li><li><strong>Brazil</strong>: US$15.99+ (6-12 working days)</li><li><strong>Chile</strong>: US$24.99 (6-12 working days)</li><li><strong>China</strong>: US$10.88 (6-7 working days)</li><li><strong>Hong Kong</strong>: HK$88.88+ (6-8 working days)</li><li><strong>Iceland</strong>: kr1,925 (3-5 working days)</li><li><strong>India</strong>: ₹1,899.99 (6-12 working days)</li><li><strong>Indonesia</strong>: Rp1,899.99 (6-12 working days)</li><li><strong>Israel</strong>: ₪39.99 (6-12 working days)</li><li><strong>Japan</strong>: ¥2,199 (6-12 working days)</li><li><strong>Malaysia</strong>: RM68.88 (6-12 working days)</li><li><strong>Mexico</strong>: US$19.99 (6-12 working days)</li><li><strong>Norway</strong>: kr145.99 (3-5 working days)</li><li><strong>Russia</strong>: US$12.99 (3-5 working days)</li><li><strong>Saudi Arabia</strong>: SR52.99 (5-7 working days)</li><li><strong>Serbia</strong>: RSD1,699.99 (3-5 working days)</li><li><strong>Singapore</strong>: S$13.99 (5-7 working days)</li><li><strong>South Africa</strong>: R349.99 (6-12 working days)</li><li><strong>South Korea</strong>: ₩14,499 (6-12 working days)</li><li><strong>Switzerland</strong>: CHF10.99 (3-4 working days)</li><li><strong>Taiwan</strong>: NT$368.88 (6-12 working days)</li><li><strong>Thailand</strong>: ฿499.99 (6-12 working days)</li><li><strong>Turkey</strong>: $11.99 (5-7 working days)</li><li><strong>Ukraine</strong>: ₴439.99+ (3-5 working days)</li><li><strong>United Arab Emirates</strong>: AED59.99 (5-7 working days)</li><li><strong>Rest of Africa</strong>: US$39.99 (6-12 working days)</li><li><strong>Rest of Central & South America</strong>: US$38.99 (6-12 working days)</li><li><strong>Rest of Europe</strong>: US$34.99 (3-5 working days)</li><li><strong>Rest of Far East & Asia</strong>: US$34.99 (6-12 working days)</li><li><strong>Rest of Middle East</strong>: US$38.99 (6-12 working days)</li><li><strong>Rest of the World</strong>: US$39.99 (6-12 working days)</li></ul><p>Need it sooner? Expedited shipping is available at checkout. If you're in a hurry, softcovers print faster than hardcovers.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_gCyPwd": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long until I receive my order?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Your book is made for you, printed on demand. Add the estimated production time below to the shipping time above for an estimated delivery date:<br/></p><ul><li><strong>USA</strong>: 3-5 working days</li><li><strong>Canada</strong>: 3-5 working days</li><li><strong>UK</strong>: 2 (softcover) - 3 (hardcover) working days</li><li><strong>Australia</strong>: 2 (softcover) - 3 (hardcover) working days</li><li><strong>New Zealand</strong>: 2 (softcover) - 3 (hardcover) working days</li><li><strong>EU</strong>: 4 (softcover) - 5 (hardcover) working days</li><li><strong>Rest of the World</strong>: 2-5 working days</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_r7dYmT": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will I be charged customs or import fees?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>We have printing partners in the USA, Canada, UK, Europe, and Australia. If you are in one of those locations, your order will be printed locally and will not attract any duties or customs fees. For all other countries, printed books are generally not subject to import duty, though some countries may apply local taxes on imported goods.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_YYC4wD": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I personalize a book?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Click the \"Personalize your book\" button below the book cover, enter your child's name, and choose your format. It takes less than a minute.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_CDNCP4": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do you have any discount codes or promotions?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes! Visit our <a href=\"https://www.piccopuppy.com/pages/offers\">Offers</a> page for current deals, or <a href=\"https://www.piccopuppy.com/pages/giveaways\">sign up to our newsletter</a> for exclusive coupons and discounts.​</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_LeYwVk": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is your money back guarantee?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>We promise you'll be happy with our 100% risk-free \"<strong>Love it or we'll make it right</strong>\"<strong>12-month happiness guarantee</strong>. If you're not happy with your order for any reason, contact us and we'll do everything we can to make it right. If you're still not satisfied, let us know within 12 months for a full refund, including return shipping.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_UE6kMi": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I track my order?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. Once your order has been printed and dispatched, you'll receive an email with your tracking number.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_Nj6n69": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will you add more books for personalization?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes! We'll soon add these titles:</p><p>Unconditional Love Series:</p><ul><li><em>I Will Always Be Proud of You</em></li><li><em>I Will Always Love You</em></li><li><em>I Wish You A Happy Birthday</em></li><li><em>Never Give Up On Your Dreams</em></li><li><em>Share The Kindness In Your Heart</em></li><li><em>Be The Best You Can Be</em></li><li><em>I Love You With All My Heart</em></li><li><em>I Will Always Believe In You</em></li></ul><p>Also coming:</p><ul><li><em>Dear Daughter</em></li><li><em>Dear Son</em></li><li><em>Grandma's Timeless Wisdom</em></li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_WLAFcQ": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are your books available for personalization in different languages?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>French, Spanish, German, and Italian editions are coming soon, in both single-language and English-bilingual formats. <a href=\"https://www.piccopuppy.com/pages/giveaways\">Sign up to our newsletter</a> to be the first to know.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_PPHiUk": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is Picco Puppy?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Picco Puppy is an indie children's picture book publisher founded by award-winning author Michael Wong. Since 2020, our books have delighted over 450,000 readers worldwide. Based in Sydney, Australia, Picco Puppy partners with printers in the US, UK, Canada, Australia, and Europe. Your book prints close to home, which means faster and more affordable shipping and support for local businesses along the way.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_EakCtp": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I contact Picco Puppy?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Michael, the author, is always happy to assist you. Reach us via the Help chat box in the bottom-right corner, our <a href=\"https://www.piccopuppy.com/pages/help\">Contact Us</a> form, or email help@piccopuppy.com.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
